# Matching-set + full answer-key audit — Round 2, 2026-w46-zh-cn-es

Method: `bslib4.Flow.match_set` (build source) prints `rights` in list order
lettered a/b/c/d in that order; the P8 key letter for each left word must be
the letter printed beside its matching definition. Verified against the
rendered SVGs (right-column letters + P8 answer-section keys) in both the ES
edition and the core. All 150 P8 keys were also read in reading order
(`p8-answers-reading-order.txt`) and checked against stems/articles.

